WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.295
Today we will notice how art can carry cultural meaning. Our work connects with

00:00:05.295 --> 00:00:06.387
communities across Africa.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:10.379
Look at a cloth pattern and point to its repeated marks.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.165
Sketch two repeated shapes from the cloth onto paper.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:20.603
Add one personal variation and explain what it represents. Explain one respectful

00:00:20.603 --> 00:00:23.755
similarity or difference with another African example.
